# Security audit finding: the whole repo was being uploaded to Vercel and
# served as static files, so anything sitting next to index.html was a public
# URL. The HANDOFF*.md notes alone spell out the schema, the RLS policies and
# the remaining known weaknesses; supabase/*.sql is the database blueprint.
# None of it is fetched by the app at runtime.
#
# Keep in sync with index.html's window.__SOURCE_ORDER — everything the boot
# sequence fetches (auth-config.js, qbo-config.js, components/auth/*,
# data.js, components/daily-close/*, app.jsx) plus styles.css,
# components/daily-close/DailyClose.css, logo.webp, the three standalone
# HTML pages and vercel.json must NOT be listed here.

# Internal notes and handoff docs
HANDOFF*.md
*.md

# Database blueprint: schema, RLS policies, edge function sources
supabase/

# Local-only build/tooling
build.py
.claude/
__pycache__/
.build-cache/

# Not fetched by index.html — internal marketing site and design-system source
marketing/
design-system/

# Archived mock data, superseded by the live `clients` roster
data-sample-clients-archive.js

# Point-in-time snapshots of the whole app taken before large refactors
.snapshot-before-*/
